# straf3 — Rust workspace

# Cargo build output. Written as `target/` (not `/target`) so a stray
# crate-local target dir is ignored too, not just the workspace root one.
target/

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. This workspace produces a binary
# (straf3-game), and the spec's determinism guarantees depend on everyone
# resolving the same dependency versions. Commit it.

# rustfmt backups
**/*.rs.bk

# Debug info from the Windows cross-build (spec rev 2 §A)
*.pdb

# Coverage / profiling instrumentation
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Local environment and editor state
.env
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# macOS
.DS_Store
